          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On devices that support Apple Intelligence, the app offers an assistant that answers questions about your payments. It uses Apple's on-device language model (the Foundation Models framework). Your question and your payment data are processed on the device; the app sends nothing off the device. If the on-device model is not available, the assistant is simply unavailable." : {
      "comment" : "Privacy policy (mirrors docs/privacy.md)",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On devices that support Apple Intelligence, the app offers an assistant that answers questions about your payments. It uses Apple's on-device language model (the Foundation Models framework). Your question and your payment data are processed on the device; the app sends nothing off the device. If the on-device model is not available, the assistant is simply unavailable."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Intelligence'ı destekleyen cihazlarda uygulama, ödemelerinizle ilgili soruları yanıtlayan bir asistan sunar. Asistan, Apple'ın cihaz üzerinde çalışan dil modelini (Foundation Models çerçevesi) kullanır. Sorunuz ve ödeme verileriniz cihazda işlenir; uygulama cihazın dışına hiçbir şey göndermez. Cihaz üzerindeki model kullanılamıyorsa asistan da kullanılamaz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
