    "Vadem tracks your credit card installments and subscriptions and shows how much you pay each month. It is built so that your data never leaves your device." : {
      "comment" : "Privacy policy (mirrors docs/privacy.md)",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vadem tracks your credit card installments and subscriptions and shows how much you pay each month. It is built so that your data never leaves your device."
          }
